          {
            "word": "peculiar",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "独特的，特殊的"
          },
          {
            "word": "fascination",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "魅力"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The more expensive kind of antique shop where rare objects are beautifully displayed in glass cases to keep them free from dust is usually a forbidding place.",
      "translation": "那种比较昂贵的古玩店，稀有物品被漂亮地陈列在玻璃柜里，以防尘埃，通常是一个令人生畏的地方。",
      "startTime": 21.2,
      "endTime": 34.64,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "forbidding",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "令人生畏的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "But no one has to muster up courage to enter a less pretentious antique shop.",
      "translation": "但没有人需要鼓起勇气进入一家不那么显眼的古玩店。",
      "startTime": 34.65,
      "endTime": 41.63,
      "analysis": {
