    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "A truly dedicated bargain hunter must have patience, and above all, the ability to recognize the worth of something when he sees it.",
      "translation": "一个真正潜心的“寻宝人”必须有耐心，最重要的是，当他看到某样东西时有识宝的能力。",
      "startTime": 59.29,
      "endTime": 69.73,
      "analysis": {
