            "meaning": "潜心"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "To do this, he must be at least as knowledgeable as the dealer.",
      "translation": "要做到这一点，他至少必须和古玩商一样博学。",
      "startTime": 69.74,
      "endTime": 75.7,
