    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Like a scientist bent on making a discovery, he must cherish the hope that one day he will be amply rewarded.",
      "translation": "就像一个致力于有所发现的科学家一样，他必须怀有这种希望：总有一天他会得到丰厚的回报。",
